## 🐛 Widget Visibility Bug Fixed — 2026-10-05 (logic correction)

**What Happened:**
Countdown widget deployed but showed on ALL products regardless of whether an active discount existed. Products without time-based discount metafield still displayed widget with "NaN : NaN : NaN : NaN" countdown. Root cause: JavaScript check `if (!discount)` doesn't work for empty objects `{}` — when no metafield exists, Liquid passes `data-discount='{}'`, which is truthy, so widget runs with undefined dates.

**Bug Details:**
- Affected: All products without time-based discount metafield (e.g., Gizzls Itchy & Scratchy treats)
- Symptom: Widget visible with NaN countdown values
- Root Cause: Empty discount object `{}` is truthy in JavaScript
- Check needed: Verify discount has required fields (startsAt, endsAt) before running

**Fix Applied:**
- **File:** `extensions/product-tier-pricing/assets/time-based-discount.js`
- **Change:** Updated validation from `if (!discount)` to `if (!discount || !discount.startsAt || !discount.endsAt) return`
- **Result:** Widget only shows on products with valid time-based discount metafield containing both dates

**Deployment Steps:**
1. Commit: `git commit -m "fix: only show countdown widget when discount has valid dates"`
2. Deploy: `shopify app deploy`
3. Verify: Hard refresh storefront — widget should only appear on products with active discount

**Widget Visibility Rules After Fix:**
- ✅ Shows: Product has time_based_discount metafield with startsAt and endsAt
- ✅ Shows: Countdown displays when now is between startsAt and endsAt (active window)
- ❌ Hidden: Product has no time_based_discount metafield
- ❌ Hidden: Metafield exists but missing startsAt or endsAt
- ❌ Hidden: Current time is outside discount window (before start or after end)

**Session Status:** Bug fix applied. Pending user deployment and verification.


